From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ninjacornix <milanvrankic@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:56:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(editor): allow custom MCP alternatives

Joinery-only setup choices, not intended for upstream. Non-preferred MCPs remain opt-in and require their own executable and argv. They are saved as project custom tools without changing preferred admission rules.
---
 editor/project_manager/project_dialog.cpp | 168 +++++++++++++++++++---
 editor/project_manager/project_dialog.h   |   7 +
 2 files changed, 158 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/editor/project_manager/project_dialog.cpp b/editor/project_manager/project_dialog.cpp
